---
kind: scene
id: day5.festival
title: Friday — The Lantern Walk
on: slotStart
when: '@festivalNight'
priority: 100
---

## The promenade at dusk

::bg{location="promenade" time="night"}
::music{action="start" mood="festive" volume="normal"}
::vfx{type="lanterns"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The whole town walks the promenade in the blue hour, carrying lanterns on sticks: fish, stars, a lopsided whale, a lantern shaped like a lantern.

<match on="quest.festivalLantern.state">
  <when is="complete">
    ::auto{character="pell" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
    @pell{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: That's ours. That's the shop's. Forty-one years.
    @narrator{code="0020"}: Your lantern is not the most beautiful on the promenade. It is the only one that is yours.
  </when>
  <when is="failed">
    @narrator{code="0030"}: The Lantern Walk starts without a lantern from the shop on Tern Street, for the first time in forty years.
    ::auto{character="pell" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
    @pell{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: Never mind, love. It's only paper.
    @sol{code="0010" mono}: It is not only paper. She has said "only paper" twice now, and her hands are shaking worse than on Monday.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0040"}: You carry nothing. It feels like forgetting someone's name.
  </otherwise>
</match>

## Down to the water

::bg{location="slipway" time="night"}
@narrator{code="0050"}: At the bottom of the slipway people crouch and let their lanterns go. The tide takes them out in a slow, glowing line toward the lighthouse.

<branch id="walkWith" prompt="Someone should be beside you when the lanterns go out.">
  <choice id="ines" label="Find Ines." into="run.festivalWith" value="ines" when="run.aff.ines >= 2">
    ::auto{character="ines" anchor="left" action="fadeInUp"}
    @ines{code="0010" emotion="shy"}: I hoped you'd look for me. I didn't want to hope it out loud.
    ::set{run.aff.ines += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="theo" label="Find Theo." into="run.festivalWith" value="theo" when="run.aff.theo >= 2">
    ::auto{character="theo" anchor="right" action="fadeInUp"}
    @theo{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Qualified hands. You floated it. I'm — yeah. Proud's a weird word. I'm that.
    ::set{run.aff.theo += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="pell" label="Stay with Aunt Pell." into="run.festivalWith" value="pell">
    ::auto{character="pell" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
    @pell{code="0030"}: You don't have to babysit me.
    @sol{code="0020"}: I know.
  </choice>
</branch>

@narrator{code="0060"}: The last lantern rounds the breakwater. For a moment the whole bay holds its breath, lit from underneath.
::music{action="fadeOut"}
